    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Weapon (Any Simple or Martial), Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This magic weapon grants a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with it. While holding it, you can take a Bonus Action to cause it to shed Bright Light in a 30-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 30 feet. You can extinguish the light as a Bonus Action.</p><p>The weapon has 4 charges. You can take a Reaction immediately after being hit by an attack roll to expend 1 of the weapon’s charges and force the attacker to make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the attacker has the &amp;Reference[Blinded apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn. The weapon regains 1d4 expended charges daily at dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-KSSBB5FDMBIAfidB\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Glissez l’enchantement sur l’arme voulue : elle garde son nom, sa rareté et son prix. Elle reçoit le bonus de +1, <em>Dazzling Light</em> (lumière sur le jeton, retirez l’effet pour l’éteindre) et <em>Dazzle</em> avec ses 4 charges.</p></section><p>@Embed[Compendium.dnd5e.content24.JournalEntry.dmgFoundryRefere.JournalEntryPage.Ok4iCgD25ENgoRxE cite=false caption=false classes=\"hide-in-embed\"]</p>",
